{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_156_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9e41d742874e93c3532349850bb8ba2820bdd9173d3803d692907303c76dbde4", "ja": "どうしてって……\n律子に似合いそうな衣装だと思ったからだけど？", "zh": "为什么啊……\n因为我觉得那是很适合律子的服装啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
