{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_156_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7355e79d6befcd34188e2e1deba141456cad981683390c57be4581ba27960b90", "ja": "そうかな？　……あ、そういえばAIはもういいのか？\n自信作だったんだろ？", "zh": "是吗？……啊，说起来，AI已经不用了吗？\n那可是你的得意之作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
