{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_156_1008_p", "source_sha256": "edaf1a572e84fab22f952de515b5d1dc7a145bab84a763550fc96c5d15a724a2", "ja": "そうか……AIについては、俺もプロデューサーとして\n考えていかないとって思ってるよ。課題だな。", "zh": "这样啊……关于AI，我也觉得自己作为制作人，必须好好思考才行。是个课题啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_156_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "9462833a00396633be4cffce8ff3d88dc09d65df06dcfab5eebb9ce7603050dd", "ja": "AIも、一長一短がある、ってことですかね。\nそれにしても……ふふっ。", "zh": "看来AI也是各有利弊呢。\n话说回来……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_156_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b7123d256c4a00efca22558771d71c70f7475e17afb98ecfbe8dcd2c42568c81", "ja": "ん？\n……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_156_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "bcee690e13ceb8d2718ad22f34ee8440ed205626c2ce7bf45ca9ff1114f5ff36", "ja": "いえ、大したことじゃないんです。ちょっと、\n{$P$}の言葉を思い出して……。", "zh": "不是，没什么大不了的。只是想起了……\n{$P$}说过的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
